      "content": "\"decisive path to resolution\"... what does that even mean? i don't see any path where this gets better. the people who were injured, their lives are changed forever because of me. i look in the mirror and i just see the cause of their pain. how can anyone ever move past something like this? i feel like i'm just a poison in every room i walk into.",
